See also Zephyr sample: :external+zephyr:zephyr:code-sample:`input-dump`.

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/subsys/input/input_dump
      :build-dir: coffeecaller_nrf52
      :board: coffeecaller_nrf52/nrf52840
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

You should see the following message on the console:

   .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

      .. parsed-literal::

         \*\*\* Booting Zephyr OS build |zephyr_version_em|\ *…*\*\*\*
         Input sample started
         I: input event: dev=gpio-keys        SYN type= 1 code= 11 value=1
         I: input event: dev=gpio-keys        SYN type= 1 code= 11 value=0
         I: input event: dev=gpio-keys        SYN type= 1 code=  5 value=1
         I: input event: dev=gpio-keys        SYN type= 1 code=  5 value=0
         I: input event: dev=gpio-keys        SYN type= 1 code=  4 value=1
         I: input event: dev=gpio-keys        SYN type= 1 code=  4 value=0
         I: input event: dev=gpio-keys        SYN type= 1 code=  3 value=1
         I: input event: dev=gpio-keys        SYN type= 1 code=  3 value=0
         I: input event: dev=gpio-keys        SYN type= 1 code=  2 value=1
         I: input event: dev=gpio-keys        SYN type= 1 code=  2 value=0
